<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for VoltVPN — Fast VPN & Proxy for Android." />
  <title>VoltVPN · Privacy Policy</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #060912;
      --bg-elevated: rgba(16, 24, 42, 0.72);
      --text: #f2f6ff;
      --muted: #9eacc4;
      --accent: #4ea1ff;
      --accent-soft: rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.14);
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --ok: #3dd68c;
      --radius: 20px;
      --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 480px at 12% -8%, rgba(46, 110, 210, 0.28), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(700px 420px at 92% 8%, rgba(34, 180, 140, 0.12), transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1222 0%, var(--bg) 40%, #05070e 100%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
    }

    .glow {
      position: fixed;
      inset: auto;
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(90px);
      opacity: 0.35;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .glow-a { top: -80px; left: -60px; background: #1d4f9c; }
    .glow-b { bottom: 10%; right: -100px; background: #0f6b55; }

    .wrap {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 18px 72px;
    }

    header.brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      animation: rise 0.6s ease both;
    }

    .brand-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .brand-copy .name {
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 0;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .brand-copy .tag {
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .support-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.28);
      color: #d7e9ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .support-chip:hover {
      background: rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.24);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .support-chip svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);
      background:
        linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), transparent 42%),
        var(--bg-elevated);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 36px 28px 30px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      animation: rise 0.7s ease 0.05s both;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto -20% -40% auto;
      width: 280px;
      height: 280px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.22), transparent 68%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.28);
      color: #b8f5d4;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow .dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ok);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.18);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .hero .lede {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      max-width: 52ch;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .meta-row {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .meta-pill {
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #c8d6ee;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
    }

    .meta-pill strong {
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .panel {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      padding: 8px 8px 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      animation: rise 0.75s ease 0.1s both;
    }

    .toc {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 14px 6px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .toc a {
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #c5d4ec;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .toc a:hover {
      color: #fff;
      border-color: rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.35);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
    }

    section {
      padding: 18px 18px 8px;
      scroll-margin-top: 24px;
    }

    section + section {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    h2 .num {
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      min-width: 1.5rem;
    }

    p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); }

    ul {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      padding-left: 1.15rem;
    }

    li {
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    li strong, p strong { color: #e8eefc; font-weight: 600; }

    a { color: var(--accent); }

    code {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.86em;
      color: #d7e7ff;
      background: rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
    }

    .callout {
      margin: 8px 0 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.22);
      color: #c9f0db;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer.page-foot {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 22px 8px 0;
      text-align: center;
      animation: rise 0.8s ease 0.15s both;
    }

    footer.page-foot .mail {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.18), rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.1));
      border: 1px solid rgba(78, 161, 255, 0.3);
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(40, 100, 200, 0.2);
    }

    footer.page-foot .mail:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(40, 100, 200, 0.32);
    }

    footer.page-foot p {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Outfit, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #7f8faa;
    }

    @keyframes rise {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .wrap { padding: 18px 14px 56px; }
      header.brand { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .support-chip { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
      .hero { padding: 28px 20px 24px; }
      .toc { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="glow glow-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="glow glow-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="brand">
      <div class="brand-left">
        <div class="brand-copy">
          <p class="name">VoltVPN</p>
          <p class="tag">Fast VPN &amp; Proxy</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="support-chip" href="mailto:supportkumaran4@gmail.com">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 5h11A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 7.5v9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5h-11A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 16.5v-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="m5.5 8 6.5 5 6.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        supportkumaran4@gmail.com
      </a>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Your privacy comes first</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This page explains how VoltVPN handles information on Android. We do not sell your data
        and we do not log your browsing activity.
      </p>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-pill"><strong>Effective</strong> · Nov 8, 2026</span>
        <span class="meta-pill"><strong>Package</strong> · <code>com.kumaran.voltvpn</code></span>
        <span class="meta-pill"><strong>Platform</strong> · Android</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="panel">
      <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <a href="#summary">Summary</a>
        <a href="#collect">What we collect</a>
        <a href="#use">How we use it</a>
        <a href="#third-parties">Third parties</a>
        <a href="#permissions">Permissions</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

      <section id="summary">
        <h2><span class="num">01</span> Summary</h2>
        <div class="callout">No-Logs policy: we do not log browsing history, DNS queries, or VPN traffic contents.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data.</li>
          <li>Traffic is routed through <strong>VPN Gate</strong> public community relays operated by volunteers — not by VoltVPN.</li>
          <li>We use <strong>Google AdMob</strong> (ads) and <strong>Firebase Analytics</strong> (app usage metrics).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="collect">
        <h2><span class="num">02</span> Information we collect</h2>
        <p>Depending on how you use the App, the following may be processed:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>App activity / diagnostics:</strong> screen views, feature taps (e.g. connect,
            disconnect, remove-ads), and diagnostic events via Firebase Analytics.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Device &amp; advertising identifiers:</strong> advertising ID and similar device
            signals used by Google AdMob to show and measure ads (subject to your device ad settings).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Local app preferences:</strong> settings stored on your device only (e.g. consent
            flag, temporary “ads removed” state).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Network / VPN technical data:</strong> Android VpnService connects you to VPN Gate
            public relays. Relay operators may see connection metadata (such as IP addresses) as part
            of providing the tunnel. VoltVPN does not operate those relays and does not store your
            browsing content.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not require account registration. We do not intentionally collect names, emails, or payment card details inside the App.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="use">
        <h2><span class="num">03</span> How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and improve VPN connectivity and app features</li>
          <li>Show advertisements and measure ad performance (AdMob)</li>
          <li>Understand aggregate usage to improve stability and UX (Firebase Analytics)</li>
          <li>Comply with law where required</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="third-parties">
        <h2><span class="num">04</span> Third-party services</h2>
        <p>The App integrates third-party services that have their own privacy policies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Google AdMob —
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Firebase Analytics —
            <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">Firebase Privacy</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            VPN Gate (University of Tsukuba public VPN project) — public community relays;
            see <a href="https://www.vpngate.net/" rel="noopener noreferrer">vpngate.net</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="permissions">
        <h2><span class="num">05</span> Permissions</h2>
        <p>VoltVPN may request:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Internet / network access — to fetch relay lists and establish VPN tunnels</li>
          <li>VPN permission (Android VpnService) — to route device traffic through a selected relay</li>
          <li>Notifications / foreground service — to keep the VPN connection running reliably</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="retention">
        <h2><span class="num">06</span> Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Local preferences remain on your device until you clear app data or uninstall.
          Analytics and advertising data are retained by Google according to their policies.
          We do not maintain a browsing activity log of your VPN sessions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="children">
        <h2><span class="num">07</span> Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>
          VoltVPN is not directed to children under 13 (or the minimum age required in your country).
          We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="choices">
        <h2><span class="num">08</span> Your choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Deny VPN permission — the App cannot create a tunnel without it</li>
          <li>Limit ad tracking in Android system settings / Google settings</li>
          <li>Uninstall the App to remove local data stored by VoltVPN</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="international">
        <h2><span class="num">09</span> International processing</h2>
        <p>
          Third-party providers (e.g. Google) and VPN Gate relays may process data in various countries.
          Relay locations depend on the server you select.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="changes">
        <h2><span class="num">10</span> Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy. The “Effective” date above will change when we do.
          Continued use of the App after updates means you accept the revised policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact">
        <h2><span class="num">11</span> Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email us at
          <a href="mailto:supportkumaran4@gmail.com">supportkumaran4@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>

    <footer class="page-foot">
      <a class="mail" href="mailto:supportkumaran4@gmail.com">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 5h11A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 7.5v9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5h-11A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 16.5v-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
          <path d="m5.5 8 6.5 5 6.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        supportkumaran4@gmail.com
      </a>
      <p>© 2026 VoltVPN · All rights reserved</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
